# Agent and admin working directories. Untracked, and one `git add -A` away
# from not being (rl-9i7, from the rl-snp deep scan).
.codex/
project-admin/

# Beads/Dolt local databases and the backups bd leaves beside them. The
# .beads/.gitignore that bd ships covers dolt/ and the server files; these are
# the ones it misses, and they are not small — 81 MB across the three of them
# as of 2026-09-06, all of it one `git add -A` from being in the history
# permanently, where 81 MB stays. Here rather than in .beads/.gitignore
# because that file is bd's, and says so.
.beads/embeddeddolt/
.beads/dolt.pre-bootstrap-*/
.beads.backup-*/
backup.jsonl
